    "strategy": "Static eight-way partition from all 281 advisory whole-file timings of successful exact-source CI. Longest-first assignment minimizes the maximum normalized Linux raw-coverage (440s) and portable Windows (450s) load; ties use Linux load then shard ID. Loader stays in shard 3, both Linux-only managed suites stay in shard 4; original relative order within each resulting shard is retained. Canonical and raw-only inventories remain separate and complete, test execution stays serial. Projections (~439s Linux; <=448s Windows apart from the isolated loader) exclude setup, queue, cache effects and unobserved runtime variance; final exact-head CI qualifies actual behavior. One new portable materialization regression suite is assigned to shard 5 without a measured timing. The unmeasured restoration lock input suite is assigned to shard 7. The private full-PR-CI request regression suite is explicitly assigned to shard 5 without a measured timing. The focused CI Input Proof successor policy suite is explicitly assigned to shard 1 without a measured timing."
